PE 850: Fractions of Powers / 幂的分数

=== Problem Description ===
Study fractions where numerator and denominator are both
powers of integers: a^m / b^n.
Count/sum over such fractions with certain constraints.

=== Small power fractions ===
Fractions a^e1 / b^e2 with 2 ≤ a,b ≤ 5, 1 ≤ e ≤ 3:
