=== Distinct reduced fractions (base ≤ 4, exp ≤ 2, value ≤ 10) ===
  Count: 24

=== Floor sums of power fractions ===
Σ_{k=1}^{5} floor(2^k / 3):
  k=1: floor(2/3) = 0, sum = 0
  k=2: floor(4/3) = 1, sum = 1
  k=3: floor(8/3) = 2, sum = 3
  k=4: floor(16/3) = 5, sum = 8
  k=5: floor(32/3) = 10, sum = 18

=== Count power fractions by base pairs ===
  (2, 3): 9 distinct values ≤ 20
  (2, 4): 7 distinct values ≤ 20
  (2, 5): 9 distinct values ≤ 20
  (3, 2): 9 distinct values ≤ 20
  (3, 4): 9 distinct values ≤ 20
  (3, 5): 9 distinct values ≤ 20
