  (4, 3): 8 distinct values ≤ 20
  (4, 5): 9 distinct values ≤ 20
  (5, 2): 7 distinct values ≤ 20
  (5, 3): 8 distinct values ≤ 20
  (5, 4): 8 distinct values ≤ 20

